From: Runeon Contributors <dev@runeon.com>
Subject: [PATCH] vcruntime140, msvcp140_1: Add version resources.

On Windows every VC14 runtime DLL carries a file version. The builtin
vcruntime140 and msvcp140_1 carry none, while msvcp140, msvcp140_2 and
vcruntime140_1 report 14.50.35719 (wine-11.1, patch 0001). A program
that checks its runtime by reading the version of each loaded VC14
DLL fails the check and refuses to start.

Give both the same 14.50.35719 version resource as the others. Data
only: no code changes and nothing keyed on a program. WineHQ master
still lacks these resources.

---
diff --git a/dlls/msvcp140_1/Makefile.in b/dlls/msvcp140_1/Makefile.in
index cb13b2a..101a212 100644
--- a/dlls/msvcp140_1/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/msvcp140_1/Makefile.in
@@ -2,4 +2,5 @@ MODULE       = msvcp140_1.dll
 PARENTSRC    = ../msvcp90
 
 SOURCES = \
-	msvcp140_1.c
+	msvcp140_1.c \
+	version.rc
diff --git a/dlls/msvcp140_1/version.rc b/dlls/msvcp140_1/version.rc
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d53d4c2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/msvcp140_1/version.rc
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
